    "innovation": "This paper combines aircraft measurements and modeling to show that 14-16 day old biomass burning plumes from central Africa sustain surprisingly high downwind ozone production over the Atlantic, identifying distinct transport pathways and demonstrating that aerosols delay the ozone peak.",
